y</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Sundial?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Sundial?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>A <b>Sundial</b> can be given to <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Sam\" title=\"Sam\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Sam in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Sam_Sprite.png/16px-Sam_Sprite.png?540f3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Sam_Sprite.png/32px-Sam_Sprite.png?540f3 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Sam\" title=\"Sam\">Sam</a> to permanently unlock <span class=\"light-color color-green\">Crop Speed</span> settings in <a href=\"/w/The_Garden#The_Desk\" title=\"The Garden\">The Desk</a>, which allows the player to change their maximum <span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><a href=\"/w/Speed\" title=\"Speed\"><span class=\"light-color color-white\" style=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xe022;&#160;</span>Speed</span></a></span> while harvesting individual crops.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Sundial?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | 