idth=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span><span class=\"invslot-stacksize\" title=\"Compacted Sunflower\" style=\"font-size:15px;right:-2px\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"rare\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;9Compacted Sunflower\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;8Collection Item//&amp;9&amp;lRARE\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Compacted_Sunflower\" title=\"Compacted Sunflower\"><img alt=\"Compacted Sunflower\" src=\"/images/thumb/Compacted_Sunflower.png/32px-Compacted_Sunflower.png?084af\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Compacted_Sunflower.png/64px-Compacted_Sunflower.png?084af 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span><span class=\"invslot-stacksize\" title=\"Compacted Sunflower\" style=\"font-size:15px;right:-2px\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"rare\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;9Compacted Sunflower\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;8Collection Item//&amp;9&amp;lRARE\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Compacted_Sunflower\" title=\"Compacted Sunflower\"><img alt=\"Compacted Sunflower\" src=\"/images/thumb/Compacted_Sunflower.png/32px-Compacted_Sunflower.png?084af\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Compacted_Sunflower.png/64px-Compacted_Sunflower.png?084af 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span><span class=\"invslot-stacksize\" title=\"Compacted Sunflower\" style=\"font-size:15px;right:-2px\">2</span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"mcui-arrow\"></span><span class=\"mcui-output\"><span class=\"invslot invslot-large\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"epic\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;5Sundial\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;7Give this item to&amp;b Sam&amp;7 to permanently /&amp;7unlock &amp;fCrop Speed &amp;7settings in your/&amp;aGarden&amp;7.//&amp;5&amp;lEPIC\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Sundial\"><img alt=\"Sundial.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Sundial.png/32px-Sundial.png?45746\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Sundial.png/64px-Sundial.png?45746 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span></span></span></span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Sundial?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Sundial?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>Upon gifting a <b>Sundial</b> to <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Sam\" title=\"Sam\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Sam in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Sam_Sprite.png/16px-Sam_Sprite.png?540f3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Sam_Sprite.png/32px-Sam_Sprite.png?540f3 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Sam\" title=\"Sam\">Sam</a>, a physical Sundial appears in <a href=\"/w/The_Garden\" title=\"The Garden\">The Garden</a> near the player's barn. Interacting with it displays the following message: <div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-7\"><span class=\"format-o\">The sundial reads &lt;time&gt;.</span></span></div></div></li>\n<li>Breaking tall grass in a garden plot will trigger the set speed cap for <a href=\"/w/Sunflower\" title=\"Sunflower\">Sunflowers</a>/<a href=\"/w/Moonflower\" title=\"Moonflower\">Moonflowers</a>. This likely happens because they all share the same base block id in older versions of Minecraft, that being <code>double_plant</code>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Sundial?section=5&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Sundial?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Gallery\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Sundial_Render.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"A Sundial placed in the world\"><img alt=\"A Sundial placed in the world\" src=\"/images/thumb/Sundial_Render.png/120px-Sundial_Render.png?9fc92\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"93\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Sundial_Render.png/240px-Sundial_Render.png?9fc92 2x\" data-file-width=\"1500\" data-file-height=\"1159\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A <b>Sundial</b> placed in the world</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Sundial?section=6&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Sundial?action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Alpha_Hypixel_Network\" title=\"Alpha Hypixel Network\">Alpha Hypixel Network</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/December_5\" title=\"Changelog/2025/December 5\">Dec&#160;5,&#160;2025</a></th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Sundial.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Sundial.png/26px-Sundial.png?45746\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Sundial.png/52px-Sundial.png?45746 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> Added <b>Sundial</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/December_12\" title=\"Changelog/2025/December 12\">Dec&#160;12,&#160;2025</a></th><td>Reworked <b>Sundial</b> to unlock Crop Speed settings instead of Plot Speed settings.</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/December_15\" title=\"Changelog/2025/December 15\">Dec&#160;15,&#160;2025</a></th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.24</th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Sundial.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Sundial.png/26px-Sundial.png?45746\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Sundial.png/52px-Sundial.png?45746 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> Added <b>Sundial</b>.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Sundial?section=7&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Navigation\" c